{"term": {"label": "道", "occurrences": 4, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "地", "id": "地"}, {"form": "就", "id": "就"}, {"form": "必", "id": "必"}, {"form": "忍", "id": "忍"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "母", "id": "母"}, {"form": "父", "id": "父"}, {"form": "牛", "id": "牛"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "罪", "id": "罪"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "足", "id": "足"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "齊", "id": "齊"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.12550508175029376, "source": "齊", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.277267285009756, "source": "齊", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.277267285009756, "source": "齊", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 2.277267285009756, "source": "齊", "target": "牛"}, {"weight": 1.8230120127321594, "source": "死", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 0.0077220460939103185, "source": "死", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.3826278006675823, "source": "死", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.3826278006675823, "source": "死", "target": "地"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "死", "target": "就"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "死", "target": "忍"}, {"weight": 2.7880929087757464, "source": "死", "target": "罪"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "死", "target": "牛"}, {"weight": 2.0541237336955462, "source": "聞", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.0541237336955462, "source": "聞", "target": "忍"}, {"weight": 1.8718021769015913, "source": "必", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.5353299402803786, "source": "必", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.6894806201076369, "source": "必", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 1.5353299402803786, "source": "必", "target": "父"}, {"weight": 1.0833448165373212, "source": "必", "tar